WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:02.500
- Welcome to the all new GRIDIRON HEIGHTS SPORTSBOOK!

00:00:02.541 --> 00:00:05.833
- [Voiceover:] GAMBLING! GAMBLING! IF YOU GAMBLE,
IT’S LIKE YOU’RE PLAYING TOO!

00:00:05.833 --> 00:00:08.583
- We’re kicking it off with a special Wild Card Tournament.

00:00:08.583 --> 00:00:09.833
- I FINALLY GET TO PLAY.

00:00:10.291 --> 00:00:11.541
- I’m alive. I swear.

00:00:11.708 --> 00:00:14.541
- [Voiceover:] USE PROMO CODE: F--KOFFORBET.

00:00:17.541 --> 00:00:19.583
- This is my first time in a casino.

00:00:19.708 --> 00:00:20.041
- Really?

00:00:20.208 --> 00:00:22.041
- [Together:] Derek imposes a curfew.

00:00:22.041 --> 00:00:23.916
- [Voiceover:] BET IN VEGAS, NOT ON VEGAS, IDIOT!

00:00:24.041 --> 00:00:26.416
- WOW, MVP-CALIBER RAISE THERE, BRADY.

00:00:26.416 --> 00:00:28.041
- Um, how much? Sorry, I didn’t quite catch that.

00:00:28.083 --> 00:00:28.708
- [Voiceover:] CHECK OUT THE...

00:00:28.708 --> 00:00:30.291
- [Kid Voiceover:] GRIDIRON HEIGHTS JR.

00:00:30.291 --> 00:00:31.458
- [Voiceover:] GAMBLING CORNER.

00:00:31.458 --> 00:00:33.666
- You see, kids, Jerry Jones is like Mr. Krabs

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:36.791
if he made his money from aggressive oil refining instead of burgers.

00:00:36.791 --> 00:00:39.416
- [Voiceover:] DON’T LIKE A PARALYZING SUN GLARE IN AN INDOOR FACILITY?

00:00:39.416 --> 00:00:40.416
PLAY OUTSIDE!

00:00:41.208 --> 00:00:42.416
- But I went all in.

00:00:44.083 --> 00:00:46.583
- [Voiceover:] OVER/UNDER HOW MANY TIMES WILL STAFFORD BLOW IT?

00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:47.958
- Can everyone stop yelling at me?

00:00:47.958 --> 00:00:49.583
- I told you, fam. We folded back in Week 14.

00:00:49.708 --> 00:00:50.291
- Well, I bet—

00:00:50.291 --> 00:00:51.041
- The game is over.

00:00:51.041 --> 00:00:53.333
- WHAT?! OH, NO, I'M MELTING.

00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:56.541
- [Al Michaels:] This team reminds me of the 2001 Patriots: They are no longer playing.

00:00:56.583 --> 00:00:59.791
- Fun fact: No one has ever sent a text about a Burrow playoff loss.

00:00:59.791 --> 00:01:02.791
- [Voiceover:] AND KEEP BETTING NEXT WEEK WHEN GREEN BAY TAKES ON THE NINERS.

00:01:02.833 --> 00:01:05.041
- WELL, WHERE'S ALEX SMITH NOW?

00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:10.375
- You know how when you’re bored of 'Rugrats' and just waiting for 'The Loud House' to come on?

00:01:10.375 --> 00:01:11.916
That’s like Jimmy G and Trey Lance. 

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.375
- A third down is like the Smurfs. 

00:01:13.416 --> 00:01:14.791
I will NOT elaborate.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.375
- See a safety is like 'Rocket Power.'

00:01:16.541 --> 00:01:17.958
What’s that? That’s not on anymore?

00:01:18.208 --> 00:01:19.083
- Your loss, kids!

